(7423991, 1132642, 59029, '<td valign="top">gritins frum crteek klub<br/> <br/>yer shutr spid too slow.  Hold camrah in hand mek pikshur jerkylookin. Pikshur ok, but nid fokl poynt and to mek shutr fastr.<br/> <br/>In English....if you want to get a nice crisp shot esp while riding in the backseat of a car, you need to use a much faster shutter.  If you''re going for a zoomblur through the windshield, then you need a tripod to stabilize your camera, and you need to use a long exposure get the desired effect.  If you''re going for something like this, that is: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=721908" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/921/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_721908.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/921/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_721908.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/921/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_721908.jpg"/></a>  Read Eric''s notes, this isn''t as difficult as it looks. Look too at his composition to see why he ribboned twice with basically the same image!<br/> <br/>Susan<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-12-31 13:09:22.</i></td>', 'gritins frum crteek klub yer shutr spid too slow.  Hold camrah in hand mek pikshur jerkylookin. Pikshur ok, but nid fokl poynt and to mek shutr fastr. In English....if you want to get a nice crisp shot esp while riding in the backseat of a car, you need to use a much faster shutter.  If you''re going for a zoomblur through the windshield, then you need a tripod to stabilize your camera, and you need to use a long exposure get the desired effect.  If you''re going for something like this, that is:   Read Eric''s notes, this isn''t as difficult as it looks. Look too at his composition to see why he ribboned twice with basically the same image! Susan', '2015-12-23 20:38:47.000000', '2015-12-31 13:09:22.000000', 0),
